5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I appreciate the silence. Let us ensure the new split reflects actual usage, not just headcount.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I worry about who actually does the math every month. It always falls on the same person, and it takes forever!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Benjamin. We need to verify if the current split truly matches our individual usage patterns.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I need to see the full year of statements before agreeing to any new structure.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,I just want us to be nice to each other. The money talk makes everyone feel a bit sad.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mio, the math is simple; the discomfort is the real cost. I will handle the calculations if we agree on the method first.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, that is so kind! But I am worried it will still eat up your evenings. I want to make sure the system is easy for everyone.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, I appreciate your concern. A simple, transparent method is best. I will look into the reconciliation template to see if it simplifies the process.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Jonathan, a template is useful, but I need the raw data first. I will check the last twelve utility statements to see the actual trends.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, I will look at the payment log to see if the money is making us feel distant.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minato, the money is not the distance; the silence is. I will check the plug-in monitor readings to see who actually uses what.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, that sounds intense! I will check the kitchen notice about the cooler to see if it is secretly using all our power.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, I will look into the sunlight and heating need by room. It seems like a quiet way to understand our different footprints.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, the cooler is a constant drain. I will check the electrician's quote for the rooms to see if we can isolate the costs properly.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minato,,"@Benjamin, I will look at the winter habits at a house paying ahead. I want to see how they keep things warm without fighting.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I will also review the trial run of the reconciliation template. Let us see if the numbers can speak without raising our voices.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Mio,,I will also check the monthly settle observed at another house. I want to see how they keep the peace while splitting the bills!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will also review the settling up when the last rooms filled. I want to see how the original agreement was formed.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will also check the payment log for the last twelve months. I need to see exactly where the money went before I commit to anything.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minato,,I will also look at the monthly settle observed at another house. I am curious how they keep the air light and friendly.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
