60,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Option C is the only one that respects the four-to-one spread. A is a lie, and B is a gamble.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, I worry C is too complicated! Who checks the meters every month? I want something that takes five minutes, not an evening.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, I understand the appeal of precision. However, Option C requires new hardware and constant monitoring. I fear it will replace our quiet peace with technical anxiety.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Benjamin, C isolates the cost, but the upfront hardware expense is a risk I have not priced. I need to know the installation fee before I can consider it.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Minato,,"@Mio, I agree. I worry the meters will make us feel watched. I just want us to be kind, not just accurate.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mio, the meters are passive; they simply record. The complexity is in the setup, not the daily life. @Victoria, the installation is a one-time cost, not a monthly drain.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, I hear you, but I am still scared of the monthly logging! If it takes forty minutes, I will definitely forget. Can we make it super easy?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, the meters are passive. You simply glance at a number once a month. It is not logging; it is just seeing.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Benjamin, a one-time cost is still a cost. I need to see the electrician's quote to know if that upfront fee is worth the long-term stability.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Minato,,"@Benjamin, I am a little scared of the meters. But I like that we do not have to argue about who used more.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Victoria, the quote is for the rooms, not the meters. The hardware is cheap; the labor is the cost. It is a one-time investment in peace.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, I am still worried about the monthly check! If it is just glancing at a number, that is fine. But who reminds us to do it?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, the reminder is a single line in the shared calendar. It is a gentle nudge, not a demand. We can set it once and forget it.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Benjamin, I am still hesitant. I need to know if the upfront cost is covered by the savings before I can agree to C.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Minato,,"@Mio, I think a gentle reminder is nice. I just want us to feel safe, not watched.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Victoria, the savings from the four-to-one spread cover the hardware within a year. It is the only option that stops the winter anxiety.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, I am still a bit nervous about the monthly check! But if it is just a quick glance, I can handle it. I just want to make sure it does not become a huge chore for anyone.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, I agree. The one-time cost buys us long-term silence. I am ready to support Option C.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Benjamin, the math is sound, but I need the exact installation figure to confirm the break-even point. I cannot vote on a promise.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Minato,,"@Victoria, I understand needing the exact number. But I worry that if we wait for perfect proof, we might keep feeling distant. Can we trust that the meters will help us be kind?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
